    {
      "id": "1a11f79e78082745",
      "body": "\nI have retired. For questions/information please contact the colleagues below:\r\n\r\nMembership contact Stephanie: sgibbs@mpif.org\r\nStandards contact Wiley: wabner@mpif.org\r\nInternational Journal of Powder Metallurgy contact Debby: dstab@mpif.org\r\nDesign Excellence Awards contact Debby: dstab@mpif.org\r\nAll Other Awards: contact Turner: tabbott@mpif.org\r\nStatistics contact Turner: tabbott@mpif.org\r\n\r\nDora Schember\r\n\n",
